{% comment %}
  Pearl Pearl DIY — fullscreen Shopify Page template.

  Why: embedding with min-height:80vh / 85vh leaves a white band under the H5
  tab bar (especially Instagram / Threads in-app browsers). Checkout
  (Cloudflare) also hangs if it stays inside a short iframe.

  Setup (recommended):
  1. Online Store → Themes → Edit code → Templates → Add a new template → page
  2. Name it e.g. "pearl-diy" and paste this entire file
  3. Online Store → Pages → create/open DIY page → Theme template → pearl-diy
  4. Do NOT put a second iframe in the Page body — this template is the embed
  5. Point Instagram / Threads bio link to that Page URL (or set it as homepage)

  Quick fix if DIY is still a Custom Liquid block on the homepage:
  replace the iframe style `min-height:85vh` with the fixed fullscreen snippet
  in README / docs/shopify-checkout.md (and hide theme header/footer).

  Cache: `v={{ 'now' | date: '%s' }}` auto-busts the iframe on each page load.
  You do NOT need to edit this URL after every GitHub Pages deploy.
{% endcomment %}
{% layout none %}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta
      name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />
    <meta http-equiv="Cache-Control" content="no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate" />
    <title>{{ page.title | default: shop.name }}</title>
    <style>
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #fff;
      }
      /* fixed + inset fills Instagram/Threads WebViews more reliably than 100dvh alone */
      #pearl-diy-frame {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        border: 0;
        background: #fff;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <iframe
      id="pearl-diy-frame"
      src="https://morningjet.github.io/pearl_agent_tw/?embed=1&v={{ 'now' | date: '%s' }}"
      title="Pearl Pearl DIY"
      allow="payment *; clipboard-write *"
      referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
    ></iframe>
  </body>
</html>
